 "description": "Quantify meetings and revenue lost when the SDR-to-AE hand-off is inconsistent, from scheduling, notes, CRM completeness, and SLA follow-up quality. See the full version at https://rahuldsarker.co/calculators/ae-sdr-hand-off-friction-calculator",
 "inputSchema": {
